  "body": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/zh-hant/learn/spelling/\">繁體中文</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-medium-blue-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/learn/spelling/\">English</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/zh-hant/learn/introduction/\">东宁音</a>虽以台北腔为主要参考基准，但并非仅是反映台北的发音。部分拼写方式反映其他地区的使用方式，亦有基于系统内部的情况而做出调整的案例。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">本页将说明这些拼写惯例，以及外来词的转写规则与特殊拼法。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. 跨地区拼写对照</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅚ 和 ㅞ：/ue/ ~ /e/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>拼写</th><th>汉字列表</th><th>标准写法</th><th>厦门 • 台北</th><th>高雄</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅚ <em>oe</em></td><td>雞, 八, 袂</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">괴<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, 뵣, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">뾔<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em>（=标准）</em></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">게<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, 벻, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뻬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>ㅞ <em>ue</em></td><td>粿, 月, 未</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">궤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">뀋<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">쀄<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">게<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">껳<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뻬<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><em>（=标准）</em></td></tr><tr><td>ㅞ <em>ue</em></td><td>瓜, 話, 花</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">궤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">웨<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˍ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">훼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em>（=标准）</em></td><td><em>（=标准）</em></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"4-the-i-ɨ-u-alternation-ㅜ-vs-ㅢ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅜ 和 ㅢ：/i/ ~ /ɨ/ ~ /u/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>拼写</th><th>汉字列表</th><th>标准写法</th><th>台北</th><th>泉州</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅜ <em>u</em></td><td>女, 私, 煮</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">루<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">수<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">주<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em><em><em>（=标准）</em></em></em></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">르<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">스<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">즈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>ㅢ <em>i</em></td><td>你, 去, 魚</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, 킈, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">희<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˏ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">루<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, 쿠, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">후<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">르<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˎ</rt></ruby>, 크, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">흐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">ㅜ/ㅢ + ㄴ：/un/ ~ /in/</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-blush-light-purple-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>拼寫</th><th>汉字列表</th><th>标准写法</th><th>厦门 • 台北</th><th>高雄</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㅜ + ㄴ <em>un</em></td><td>斤, 跟, 銀</td><td><strong><ruby style=\"position: relative\">군<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">군<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˏ</rt></ruby></strong></td><td><em><em><em><em><em>（=标准）</em></em></em></em></em></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">긘<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">긘<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">끤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.15em\">ˏ</rt></ruby></ruby></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"5-nasal-initials-and-nasal-final-ㄹ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. 鼻音聲母後的鼻化韻尾</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">在 ㄴ、ㅁ 或 ㆆ 之後，原本的鼻音韻尾 ㄹ 不再重複書寫。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes has-medium-font-size\"><table class=\"has-very-light-gray-to-cyan-bluish-gray-gradient-background has-background has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>子音</th><th>汉字列表</th><th>台北</th><th>高雄</th><th>非标准</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ㄴ, ㅁ, ㆆ</td><td>呢, 暝, 硬</td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">니<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">미<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᅙᅵ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">네<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">메<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᅙᅦ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">닐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">밀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˏ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᅙᅦᆯ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ˍ</rt></ruby></td></tr><tr><td>其他所有字母</td><td>衫, 星</td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">살<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">칠<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></td><td><ruby style=\"position: relative\">살<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">첼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></ruby></td><td><em>（不适用）</em></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"6-spelling-exceptions\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. 特殊拼写</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"7-外来语转录\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. 外来语转录</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"i-ə-之转录-ㅓ-ㄹ-ə\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">i. /ə/ 之转录（ㅡ + ㅔ → /ə/）</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong>/ə/</strong> 音，写作 <strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif\">ᅟힻ</span></strong></strong></strong></strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby style=\"position: relative\"><ruby>ᄉힻ<rp>(ꞈ)</rp></ruby><rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /səː/（英语 <em>sir</em>）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">/uə/ 和 /iə/ 则转写为 우ᄋힻ 和 이ᄋힻ。</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"ii-d-和-r-转录为-ɾ\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">ii. /d/ 和 /r/ 转录为 /<strong>ɾ</strong>/</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong><strong>/d/ </strong></strong>以及 <strong>/r/</strong> 音在闽南语的发音为 <strong>/ɾ/</strong>，写作 <strong><strong><strong>ㄸ</strong></strong></strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby style=\"position: relative\">떼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뚀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /ɾe.ɾio/ (英语 <em>radio</em>)</ruby></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"iv-z-之转录\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">iii. /z/ 之转录</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong><strong>/z/</strong></strong> 音，写作 <strong><strong><strong>ㅉ</strong></strong></strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby style=\"position: relative\">찝<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /zip/ (英语 <em>zip</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"iii-dʒ-之转录\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">iv. /dʒ/ 之转录</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong><strong>/dʒ/</strong></strong> 音，写作 <strong><strong>ㅉ</strong></strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><ruby style=\"position: relative\">찜<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /dʒim/ (英语 <em>gym</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"v-v-之转录\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">v. /v/ 之转录</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong>/v/</strong> 音，写作 <strong>쁘</strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>쁘<ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">뚀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /bi.rio/ (英语 <em>video</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><ruby style=\"position: relative\">래<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>쁘 /laɪb/ (英语 <em>live</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"vi-f-之转录\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">vi. /f/ 之转录</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">外来语的 <strong>/f/</strong> 音，写作 <strong>흐</strong>。</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><strong>例：</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>흐<ruby style=\"position: relative\">띠<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> /hri/ (英语 <em>free</em>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>흐<ruby style=\"position: relative\">에<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>스 /hes/ (英语 <em>face</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n"
}
